yaview
======

yaview is a modified version of sioyek (https://github.com/ahrm/sioyek), a PDF viewer
written by ahrm (https://github.com/ahrm) and the sioyek contributors.

sioyek is Copyright (C) ahrm and the sioyek contributors.
