Modification notice (GNU GPL v3, section 5a): this work was forked from sioyek's
development branch at commit 78b94e2115f60eb124df266d13eb2838da42c5b5. It was changed and
renamed from "sioyek" to "yaview" by alexyavo starting on 2026-10-14. The git history of
https://github.com/alexyavo/yaview lists every change.

The application icon (resources/yaview-icon.png and the icons derived from it) is new in yaview.
The bundled tutorial.pdf comes from sioyek unchanged.

